---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AssetBattleSimulator from '../../components/AssetBattleSimulator.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="100M KRW 10-Year Compounding Battle: 6 Major Assets Comparison | MegaMoneyMomentum (MMM)"
  description="Real-time multi-asset compounding simulation for US S&P 500, NASDAQ 100, SCHD (Monthly Cash Flow), Korean 20-Year Sovereign Bonds, KRX Gold, and Bank Deposits."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding: 1rem 0 4rem 0;">
    <AssetBattleSimulator isEn={true} />

    <!-- Explanatory Guide Section -->
    <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 3rem auto 0 auto; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
          <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line>
        </svg>
        Historical Backtesting & Simulation Methodology
      </h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        This engine models 20-year empirical compound annual growth rates (CAGR) and dividend reinvestment compounding across major asset classes:
      </p>
      <ul style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <li><strong>NASDAQ 100 (QQQM) & S&P 500 (SPLG)</strong>: Historical CAGRs of 14.2% and 10.5% with dividend reinvestment.</li>
        <li><strong>SCHD Dividend Growth</strong>: 3.6% starting dividend yield compounding at a 10% annual dividend growth rate to calculate future monthly cash flow.</li>
        <li><strong>Tax-Sheltered Accounts (ISA/IRP)</strong>: Shielding 15.4% dividend withholding and 22% capital gains tax compounds into significant additional net worth.</li>
      </ul>
      <div style="background: var(--primary-light); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 1rem 1.25rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: gap; gap: 0.75rem;">
        <span style="font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary);">Discover where your net worth ranks in Korea</span>
        <a href="/en/ladder" style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">Open Wealth Ladder Diagnosis ➔</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
